{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34370","headline":"袭美病中闻余游顔家园见寄次韵酬之 · 陆龟蒙","name":"袭美病中闻余游顔家园见寄次韵酬之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"日华风蕙正交光，羯末相携籍草塘。\n佳酒旋倾醽醁嫩，短船闲弄木兰香。\n烟丝鸟拂来萦带，蘂榼人收去约簧。\n今日好爲联句会，不成刚爲欠檀郎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34370.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34370","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}